  "Software Details": "Подробности программного обеспечения",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "Модуль маркетинга в eCommerceGo SaaS призван революционизировать способы продвижения вашего бизнеса. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Посмотреть живую демонстрацию",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Расширьте охват своего бизнеса с помощью модуля «Маркетинг»",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Увеличьте свои продажи с помощью нашего мощного маркетингового модуля, предназначенного для оптимизации кампаний, отслеживания эффективности и легкого стимулирования роста.",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "С легкостью создавайте и редактируйте свой бизнес-профиль",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "Начинаете новый бизнес или управляете несколькими брендами? ",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Выбирайте из множества бизнес-тем",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "Модуль «Маркетинг» также предлагает ряд настраиваемых бизнес-тем для улучшения презентации вашего бренда. ",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Стимулируйте рост с помощью настраиваемых маркетинговых кампаний",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "Поднимите свой бизнес на новый уровень, запустив динамические маркетинговые кампании прямо с платформы. ",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "Оптимизируйте свои маркетинговые усилия с помощью многофункциональных инструментов",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "Благодаря модулю «Маркетинг» управление маркетинговой деятельностью вашего бизнеса стало еще проще. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Почему стоит выбирать специальные модули",
